  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICMPS 2021, JakartaEM, Yayasan Planet Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to build on the existing work and engagement of rural communities to create village-led partnerships to improve human well-being and combat climate change. Projects inputs will include technical assistance, mentoring, and peer-to-peer support for 6 partner CSOs in Indonesia to promote environmental sustainability, develop a learning network for CSOs and Planet Indonesia partners to improve best practices in holistic conservation approaches that improve human well-being and reduce biodiversity loss, and establish 6 Savings and Loans groups set up with local CSOs to improve livelihood security.</narrative>
  </description>
